{
  "analysis": "Now I can see doomgeneric_img.c includes only "my_stdlib.h" and expects it to provide stdint types, FILE, printf, malloc, string functions, etc. I need to create my_stdlib.h and a freestanding libc implementation. First I will create a comprehensive my_stdlib.h, then recompile all sources and link to collect all undefined symbols from Doom. The custom main currently calls `main(0,0)`, which gives argc=0; I will need to fix that to provide argv with the WAD path.",
  "plan": "Create my_stdlib.h with standard types and function declarations. Recompile all Doom sources and link with -nostdlib to collect undefined symbols. Then implement the needed libc functions in a shim using VM syscalls.",
